==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|donc}}, variant of {{m|frm|doncques}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|donkes||then}}. Of uncertain and disputed origin. Perhaps an [[apheresis]] of {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|adonc}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la||ad-tunc}}, or a blend of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|dum||while}} + {{m|la|tum}}, {{m|la|tunc||then}}. Compare also {{cog|it|dunque}}.

